      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Finalize Consent\nOn an APPROVED consent request: relocate the incumbent via Move Booking (as the incumbent, owner=true), then PLACE the requester - by Move (move-preempt) or Book (book-preempt), per placeTarget. All-or-nothing move-first. Marks the Consent Requests row DONE/FAILED and notifies both. Logic mirrors workflows/drafts/consent/finalize.js (33/33). executeWorkflow/Sheets-update wiring validates at the coordinated live QA. Inactive until wired.",
